          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you'd like me to photograph your wedding,\n email me here. \n\nPlease feel free to include:\n\nYour names, your wedding date, the venue or town and a rough guest count.\n\nTell me a little about the day you're planning, feel free to include a link to a mood-board if you've made one. \n\nI'll reply with my packages and we can set up a video call to talk it through further.",
